variable C31 equal 0.5*(${C3neg}+${C3pos})
variable C31 equal 0.5*(26462.7260799312+${C3pos})
variable C31 equal 0.5*(26462.7260799312+-26130.6744973209)
variable C4${dir} equal 0.5*(${C4neg}+${C4pos})
variable C41 equal 0.5*(${C4neg}+${C4pos})
variable C41 equal 0.5*(72.929048105168+${C4pos})
variable C41 equal 0.5*(72.929048105168+-72.950916233579)
variable C5${dir} equal 0.5*(${C5neg}+${C5pos})
